          <mxCell id="02-login-session-evidence" value="证据（当前代码）：&lt;br&gt;SecurityConfiguration.java:53-85（放行规则 / admin 角色 / 无状态会话）&lt;br&gt;SecurityConfiguration.java:104-155（2FA 428、JWT 签发、登出黑名单）&lt;br&gt;JwtAuthorizeFilter.java:32-49（解析 token 并注入 request.id）&lt;br&gt;JwtUtils.java:43-105（黑名单、验签、过期、签发）&lt;br&gt;TwoFactorServiceImpl.java:78-96 / TwoFactorLoginController.java:25-42（challenge 与 TOTP 校验）&lt;br&gt;net/index.ts:249-315（登录、2FA、登出、401 处理）&lt;br&gt;router/index.ts:218-245（路由守卫与游客模式）&lt;br&gt;LoginPage.vue:94-128（428 弹窗）" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1473" width="1120" height="146" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
